op = output→latched skills.md/project-instructions memory cell ("feedback once → kept"). 3-state colour + one scarce red. §7 bans the pyramid, the app/logo grid, apex-as-hero, free-standing multipliers, red-flooding, and glowing-brain/rocket clichés. KEY SEPARATION from Cognitive 4.0 (also a vertical power supply): 4.0 = single always-on base rail + gated detours ("where you live"); 1.0 = six-board series stack with a climbing boot order ("the order you build"). FIRST Productivity Enhancement concept; OPENS the 7-part Productivity Enhancement track (13 articles). Authoritative note in concepts/blog-viz-tracker.md.
